@startuml
' 食有灵 FOOD SOUL —— 顺序图：AI 菜品对话（含配置裁决与流式输出）
' 依据：server/api.mjs handleChat / resolveAIForRequest / sse，
'       server/site-ai.mjs resolveAIConfig，
'       server/ai-adapter.mjs chatStream，server/prompt.mjs buildDishSystemPrompt
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor White
skinparam NoteBorderColor Black
skinparam NoteFontColor Black
skinparam DefaultFontColor Black
skinparam ArrowFontColor Black
skinparam ArrowFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeFontColor Black
skinparam ActivityFontColor Black
skinparam StateFontColor Black

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor Black
  BorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor Black
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  GroupBorderColor Black
  GroupBackgroundColor White
}

actor "用户" as U
participant "chat 页面\n(src/views/chat.js)" as FE
participant "api.mjs\nhandleChat" as API
participant "site-ai.mjs\nresolveAIConfig" as SITE
database "SQLite\ndata/foodsoul.db" as DB
participant "prompt.mjs\nbuildDishSystemPrompt" as P
participant "ai-adapter.mjs\nchatStream" as AD
participant "模型服务\n/chat/completions" as LLM

U -> FE : 输入问题并发送
FE -> API : POST /api/chat { dishId, messages }
activate API
API -> API : sameOrigin(req)
opt 来源不合法
  API --> FE : 403 非法请求来源
end
API -> SITE : resolveAIForRequest(req, res, "chat")
activate SITE
SITE -> DB : 读 site_ai 总开关 + 启用的 site_ai_profiles
DB --> SITE : enabled, provider, base_url, model, key_cipher
alt 内置 AI 可用
  SITE --> API : { ok, config, source: "site" }
else 内置不可用且已登录
  SITE -> DB : 读 ai_configs（AES-256-GCM 解密）
  DB --> SITE : provider, base_url, model, apiKey
  SITE --> API : { ok, config, source: "user" }
else 无可用配置
  SITE --> API : { ok: false, code: "ai_disabled" / "ai_config_unavailable" }
  API --> FE : 409 { code, error }
end
deactivate SITE

API -> API : 取最近 12 条消息，单条截断 1200 字符
API -> P : buildDishSystemPrompt(dish, persona)
P --> API : system（人格段 + 事实段）
API -> AD : chatStream({ baseUrl, apiKey, model, system, messages })
activate AD
API --> FE : data: {"type":"meta", model, personaId, ...}
AD -> LLM : POST /chat/completions (stream: true, timeout 120s)
activate LLM
loop 每个增量
  LLM --> AD : data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}
  AD --> API : onDelta(text)
  API --> FE : data: {"type":"delta","text":"..."}
end
LLM --> AD : data: [DONE]
deactivate LLM
alt 上游返回 401 / 429 / 5xx
  AD --> API : throw AIError(code = auth / quota / server)
  API --> FE : data: {"type":"error","message":"..."}
else 正常结束
  AD --> API : 流结束
  API --> FE : data: {"type":"done"}
end
deactivate AD
deactivate API
FE --> U : 逐字追加显示，结束后可重新生成
note right of API : 游客调用 AI 另有 20 次/分钟限流，超限返回 429
@enduml
